{"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"language":"python","display_name":"Python 3","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.12.13","mimetype":"text/x-python","codemirror_mode":{"name":"ipython","version":3},"pygments_lexer":"ipython3","nbconvert_exporter":"python","file_extension":".py"},"kaggle":{"accelerator":"none","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"competition","sourceId":147734}],"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false}},"nbformat_minor":4,"nbformat":4,"cells":[{"cell_type":"code","source":"from kaggle_environments import make, evaluate\n\n# Create the game environment\n# Set debug=True to see the errors if your agent refuses to run\nenv = make(\"kaggriculture\", debug=True)\n\n# List of available default agents\nprint(list(env.agents))","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-10T13:32:48.472282Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-10T13:32:48.472536Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-08-10T13:32:57.692106Z","shell.execute_reply.started":"2026-08-10T13:32:48.472507Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-08-10T13:32:57.691025Z"}},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","text":"[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO: Successfully loaded OpenSpiel environments: 24.\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_amazons\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_backgammon\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_checkers\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_chess\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_clobber\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_coin_game\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_coin_game_arena\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_connect_four\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_dark_hex\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_gin_rummy\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_go\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_goofspiel\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_hearts\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_hex\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_lines_of_action\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_matching_pennies_3p\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_oshi_zumo\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_othello\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_repeated_game\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_tic_tac_toe\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_y\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_universal_poker\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_repeated_poker\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    open_spiel_python_repeated_pokerkit\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO: OpenSpiel games skipped: 1.\n[kaggle_environments.envs.open_spiel_env.open_spiel_env] INFO:    snake\n['pass', 'random', 'starter']\n","output_type":"stream"}],"execution_count":1},{"cell_type":"code","source":"env.run(['random', 'random'])\nenv.render(mode=\"ipython\")","metadata":{"trusted":true,"execution":{"iopub.status.busy":"2026-08-10T13:32:57.694281Z","iopub.execute_input":"2026-08-10T13:32:57.694886Z"}},"outputs":[],"execution_count":null},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["## Strategy\n\nA greedy, stateless multi-worker farm manager. Every turn it's recomputed fresh from the observation (no persisted state needed):\n\n- **Hire cheap farm hands every morning.** Hire cost resets daily and follows Fibonacci growth (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, ...), so the first several hands per day are nearly free -- but a hard per-hire cost cap stops us from paying $89+ for a hand our farm has no real work for.\n- **Spatial zoning.** Owned tiles are split into compact row-major zones, one per unit, so workers mostly tend a local patch instead of criss-crossing the whole board chasing the globally-nearest task -- this alone roughly doubled the final score in testing by cutting wasted travel turns.\n- **Per-unit priority policy:** harvest ripe tiles \u2192 water thirsty plants \u2192 care/feed/collect from animals \u2192 fertilize \u2192 clear weeds \u2192 plant empty tiles with the best-value crop we can afford \u2192 animal logistics (pickup \u2192 feed / fertilize / place) \u2192 drop carried goods at the shed \u2192 help out another zone if our own has nothing left to do.\n- **Tiered cash reserves.** A single \"never spend below $X\" floor causes a death spiral: once cash dips under it, even a $10 seed purchase gets blocked, production halts, and cash never recovers. Routine costs (hiring, seeds, feed) use a small reserve; only big one-time bets (land, animals) use a larger one.\n- **The scoreboard is cash on hand at the final step** -- unsold shed goods, live animals, unplanted seeds and owned-but-idle land are all worth $0. So every investment is gated by whether there's enough season left to convert it back to cash via a harvest + sell before the game ends, and animals stop getting fed once there's no more time for another production cycle."],"metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["%%writefile submission.py\n","\n","# Kaggriculture agent: greedy multi-worker farm manager.\n","#\n","# Strategy summary:\n","#  - Hire cheap farm hands every morning (Fibonacci hire cost resets daily,\n","#    so 6-10 hands/day costs almost nothing relative to their output).\n","#  - Every unit (farmer + hands) runs the same stateless priority policy each\n","#    turn, recomputed fresh from the observation: harvest ripe tiles, water\n","#    thirsty plants, feed/care/collect from animals, fertilize, clear weeds,\n","#    plant empty tiles with the best-value crop we can afford/seed, run\n","#    animal logistics (pickup -> place, pickup -> feed, pickup -> fertilize),\n","#    and drop carried goods at the shed when there's nothing more urgent.\n","#  - A single market-order pass each turn sells shed surplus, restocks seeds,\n","#    buys animals/wheat as needed, expands land, and hires hands.\n","\n","import math\n","\n","CROPS = {\n","    \"WHEAT\":      {\"seed\": 10, \"first_yield_day\": 2, \"max_yield_day\": 4, \"interval\": 0, \"max_yield\": 6, \"ongoing\": False},\n","    \"CARROT\":     {\"seed\": 20, \"first_yield_day\": 2, \"max_yield_day\": 3, \"interval\": 0, \"max_yield\": 4, \"ongoing\": False},\n","    \"TOMATO\":     {\"seed\": 50, \"first_yield_day\": 8, \"max_yield_day\": 8, \"interval\": 1, \"max_yield\": 4, \"ongoing\": True},\n","    \"STRAWBERRY\": {\"seed\": 100, \"first_yield_day\": 10, \"max_yield_day\": 10, \"interval\": 2, \"max_yield\": 4, \"ongoing\": True},\n","    \"MELON\":      {\"seed\": 80, \"first_yield_day\": 10, \"max_yield_day\": 12, \"interval\": 0, \"max_yield\": 6, \"ongoing\": False},\n","}\n","\n","ANIMALS = {\n","    \"GOOSE\": {\"cost\": 300, \"structure\": \"COOP\",    \"first_yield_day\": 4, \"interval\": 1, \"max_held\": 4, \"product\": \"EGG\"},\n","    \"COW\":   {\"cost\": 400, \"structure\": \"PASTURE\", \"first_yield_day\": 8, \"interval\": 2, \"max_held\": 6, \"product\": \"MILK\"},\n","    \"SHEEP\": {\"cost\": 500, \"structure\": \"PASTURE\", \"first_yield_day\": 6, \"interval\": 3, \"max_held\": 6, \"product\": \"WOOL\"},\n","}\n","\n","PRODUCTS = [\"WHEAT\", \"CARROT\", \"TOMATO\", \"STRAWBERRY\", \"MELON\", \"EGG\", \"MILK\", \"WOOL\", \"FERTILIZER\"]\n","\n","MAX_HANDS = 12\n","# Tiered reserves: a single \"never spend below $X\" floor causes a death\n","# spiral if X is set high enough to gate big-ticket buys (land/animals) --\n","# once cash dips under it, essential $10 seed purchases get blocked too,\n","# production halts, and cash can never climb back out. So routine operating\n","# costs (hiring, seeds, feed) get a much smaller floor than land/animals.\n","OPERATING_RESERVE = 20\n","MIN_CASH_RESERVE = 250\n","HIRE_COST_CAP = 21  # skip a hire once that day's next Fibonacci hire cost exceeds this\n","LAND_BUY_SURPLUS = 500  # extra cushion (beyond the reserve) required before buying land\n","WHEAT_FEED_RESERVE = 6  # wheat units kept in the shed for feeding animals (dropped near the end)\n","MAX_MARKET_ORDERS = 10\n","# Fast, cheap crops used to bootstrap cash before capital allows anything else.\n","STARTER_CROPS = [\"WHEAT\", \"CARROT\"]\n","\n","# The scoreboard is *cash on hand* at the final step -- unsold shed goods,\n","# live animals, unplanted seeds, and owned-but-idle land are all worth $0.\n","# So every investment (seed, land, structure, animal) is only worth making\n","# if there's enough runway left in the season to convert it back to cash\n","# via a HARVEST + SELL before the game ends. These knobs encode that runway.\n","SELL_LEAD_DAYS = 1     # days of buffer to harvest + sell after a crop matures\n","LAND_MIN_REMAINING_DAYS = 10\n","COOP_MIN_REMAINING_DAYS = 8\n","PASTURE_MIN_REMAINING_DAYS = 10\n","\n","\n","def _get(d, key, default):\n","    if isinstance(d, dict):\n","        return d.get(key, default)\n","    return getattr(d, key, default)\n","\n","\n","def _crop_feasible(crop, day, remaining_days):\n","    \"\"\"Is there enough season left to plant, grow, harvest and sell this crop?\"\"\"\n","    cd = CROPS[crop]\n","    if cd[\"ongoing\"]:\n","        # Needs to reach first_yield_day and then get at least one more\n","        # production tick (interval) to be worth the seed cost.\n","        return remaining_days - cd[\"first_yield_day\"] - max(cd[\"interval\"], 1) >= SELL_LEAD_DAYS\n","    return remaining_days - cd[\"max_yield_day\"] >= SELL_LEAD_DAYS\n","\n","\n","def _board_size(farm):\n","    return len(farm[\"tiles\"])\n","\n","\n","def _shed_access_tiles(board_size):\n","    half = board_size // 2\n","    return [(half - 1, half - 1), (half, half - 1), (half - 1, half), (half, half)]\n","\n","\n","def _is_shed_adjacent(pos, board_size):\n","    return tuple(pos) in set(_shed_access_tiles(board_size))\n","\n","\n","def _manhattan(a, b):\n","    return abs(a[0] - b[0]) + abs(a[1] - b[1])\n","\n","\n","def _nearest(pos, candidates):\n","    if not candidates:\n","        return None\n","    return min(candidates, key=lambda c: _manhattan(pos, c))\n","\n","\n","def _zone_assignment(owned, n_units):\n","    \"\"\"Split owned tiles into n_units row-major (spatially compact) chunks,\n","    one per unit, so units mostly work a local patch instead of criss-\n","    crossing the whole board chasing whatever task is globally nearest.\"\"\"\n","    if n_units <= 0:\n","        return []\n","    ordered = sorted(owned, key=lambda p: (p[1], p[0]))\n","    chunk = max(1, math.ceil(len(ordered) / n_units))\n","    return [set(ordered[i * chunk:(i + 1) * chunk]) for i in range(n_units)]\n","\n","\n","def _step_towards(pos, target):\n","    dx = target[0] - pos[0]\n","    dy = target[1] - pos[1]\n","    if dx == 0 and dy == 0:\n","        return \"PASS\"\n","    if abs(dx) >= abs(dy):\n","        return \"EAST\" if dx > 0 else \"WEST\"\n","    return \"SOUTH\" if dy > 0 else \"NORTH\"\n","\n","\n","def _owned_tiles(farm):\n","    board_size = _board_size(farm)\n","    out = []\n","    for y in range(board_size):\n","        row = farm[\"tiles\"][y]\n","        for x in range(board_size):\n","            if row[x] != \"LOCKED\":\n","                out.append((x, y))\n","    return out\n","\n","\n","def _crop_score(crop, price):\n","    cd = CROPS[crop]\n","    # Round-trip cycle: time to first cash back, plus time to squeeze out the\n","    # full yield. Penalizes slow, capital-heavy crops (e.g. MELON) relative\n","    # to fast ones (WHEAT/CARROT) even though their asymptotic $/day is high.\n","    cycle = max(cd[\"first_yield_day\"] + cd[\"max_yield_day\"], 1)\n","    return (cd[\"max_yield\"] * price - cd[\"seed\"]) / cycle\n","\n","\n","def _best_new_crop(money, market_prices, seeds, day, remaining_days):\n","    \"\"\"Pick the crop with the best expected $/day/tile among crops we already hold seeds for.\"\"\"\n","    candidates = [c for c, n in seeds.items() if n > 0 and _crop_feasible(c, day, remaining_days)]\n","    if day < 5 or money < 800:\n","        candidates = [c for c in candidates if c in STARTER_CROPS] or candidates\n","    best, best_score = None, -1.0\n","    for crop in candidates:\n","        price = market_prices.get(crop, CROPS[crop][\"seed\"] * 3)\n","        score = _crop_score(crop, price)\n","        if score > best_score:\n","            best, best_score = crop, score\n","    return best\n","\n","\n","def _crop_to_buy(money, market_prices, day, remaining_days):\n","    \"\"\"Pick the best crop to restock seeds for, gating expensive/slow crops\n","    behind having real capital, and behind having enough season left to ever\n","    turn the seed back into cash.\"\"\"\n","    candidates = [c for c in CROPS if _crop_feasible(c, day, remaining_days)]\n","    if day < 5 or money < 800:\n","        candidates = [c for c in candidates if c in STARTER_CROPS]\n","    best, best_score = None, -1.0\n","    for crop in candidates:\n","        cd = CROPS[crop]\n","        if cd[\"seed\"] > money - OPERATING_RESERVE:\n","            continue\n","        price = market_prices.get(crop, cd[\"seed\"] * 3)\n","        score = _crop_score(crop, price)\n","        if score > best_score:\n","            best, best_score = crop, score\n","    return best\n","\n","\n","def agent(obs, config=None):\n","    obs = dict(obs) if not isinstance(obs, dict) else obs\n","    farms = obs.get(\"farms\", [])\n","    player = obs.get(\"player\", 0)\n","    private = obs.get(\"private\", {}) or {}\n","    market = obs.get(\"market\", {}) or {}\n","    day = obs.get(\"day\", 0)\n","    hour = obs.get(\"hour\", 0)\n","\n","    episode_steps = int(_get(config, \"episodeSteps\", 720)) if config is not None else 720\n","    turns_per_day = int(_get(config, \"turnsPerDay\", 24)) if config is not None else 24\n","    total_days = max(1, episode_steps // turns_per_day)\n","    remaining_days = total_days - day  # includes today\n","\n","    if not farms or player >= len(farms):\n","        return {\"farmer\": [\"PASS\"], \"hands\": [], \"market\": []}\n","\n","    farm = farms[player]\n","    board_size = _board_size(farm)\n","    tiles = farm[\"tiles\"]\n","    money = farm[\"money\"]\n","    shed = dict(private.get(\"shed\", {}) or {})\n","    seeds = dict(private.get(\"seeds\", {}) or {})\n","    inventories = private.get(\"inventories\", [{}]) or [{}]\n","    prices = market.get(\"prices\", {}) or {}\n","\n","    owned = _owned_tiles(farm)\n","\n","    # ---- classify tiles ----\n","    harvest_tiles, water_tiles, weed_tiles, empty_tiles = [], [], [], []\n","    animal_feed_tiles, animal_care_tiles, animal_collect_tiles = [], [], []\n","    empty_coop_tiles, empty_pasture_tiles = [], []\n","    fertilizable_tiles = []\n","\n","    coop_count = pasture_count = 0\n","    goose_count = sheep_count = cow_count = 0\n","\n","    for (x, y) in owned:\n","        tile = tiles[y][x]\n","        if tile is None:\n","            empty_tiles.append((x, y))\n","        elif isinstance(tile, dict):\n","            kind = tile.get(\"kind\")\n","            if kind == \"WEED\":\n","                weed_tiles.append((x, y))\n","            elif kind == \"PLANT\":\n","                crop = tile[\"crop\"]\n","                cd = CROPS[crop]\n","                age = day - tile[\"planted_day\"]\n","                if tile.get(\"yield_units\", 0) > 0 and age >= cd[\"first_yield_day\"]:\n","                    harvest_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                if not tile.get(\"watered_today\"):\n","                    water_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                if tile.get(\"fertilized_until_day\", -1) < day and remaining_days > 1:\n","                    fertilizable_tiles.append((x, y))\n","            elif kind in (\"COOP\", \"PASTURE\"):\n","                if kind == \"COOP\":\n","                    coop_count += 1\n","                else:\n","                    pasture_count += 1\n","                if \"animal\" in tile:\n","                    animal = tile[\"animal\"]\n","                    if animal == \"GOOSE\":\n","                        goose_count += 1\n","                    elif animal == \"SHEEP\":\n","                        sheep_count += 1\n","                    elif animal == \"COW\":\n","                        cow_count += 1\n","                    if tile.get(\"yield_units\", 0) > 0:\n","                        harvest_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                    if not tile.get(\"fed_today\") and remaining_days > 1:\n","                        animal_feed_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                    if not tile.get(\"cared_today\"):\n","                        animal_care_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                    if tile.get(\"fertilizer_available\"):\n","                        animal_collect_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                else:\n","                    if kind == \"COOP\":\n","                        empty_coop_tiles.append((x, y))\n","                    else:\n","                        empty_pasture_tiles.append((x, y))\n","\n","    want_coop = day >= 2 and remaining_days >= COOP_MIN_REMAINING_DAYS\n","    want_pasture = day >= 6 and remaining_days >= PASTURE_MIN_REMAINING_DAYS\n","    goose_target = ANIMALS[\"GOOSE\"][\"max_held\"] if want_coop else 0\n","    sheep_target = ANIMALS[\"SHEEP\"][\"max_held\"] if want_pasture else 0\n","\n","    need_build_coop = want_coop and coop_count == 0\n","    need_build_pasture = want_pasture and pasture_count == 0\n","\n","    plant_crop = (\n","        _best_new_crop(money, prices, seeds, day, remaining_days)\n","        or _crop_to_buy(money, prices, day, remaining_days)\n","    )\n","    # Near the end of the season, keep animals fed only if they'll produce\n","    # again before the game ends -- otherwise the wheat is better sold.\n","    wheat_feed_reserve = WHEAT_FEED_RESERVE if remaining_days > 1 else 0\n","\n","    claimed = set()\n","\n","    def claim(pos):\n","        claimed.add(pos)\n","\n","    def pick_target(candidates, unit_pos, zone=None, strict=False):\n","        avail = [c for c in candidates if c not in claimed]\n","        if zone:\n","            in_zone = [c for c in avail if c in zone]\n","            if in_zone or strict:\n","                return _nearest(unit_pos, in_zone)\n","        return _nearest(unit_pos, avail)\n","\n","    # ---- per-unit decision ----\n","    def decide_unit(unit_pos, inv, zone=None):\n","        tile = tiles[unit_pos[1]][unit_pos[0]]\n","        inv = inv or {}\n","\n","        # 1) carrying wheat -> feed a hungry animal\n","        if inv.get(\"WHEAT\", 0) > 0 and animal_feed_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in animal_feed_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"FEED\"]\n","            t = pick_target(animal_feed_tiles, unit_pos)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 2) carrying fertilizer -> fertilize a crop\n","        if inv.get(\"FERTILIZER\", 0) > 0 and fertilizable_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in fertilizable_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"FERTILIZE\"]\n","            t = pick_target(fertilizable_tiles, unit_pos)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 3) carrying an animal -> place it in a matching empty structure\n","        for animal, adata in ANIMALS.items():\n","            if inv.get(animal, 0) > 0:\n","                targets = empty_coop_tiles if adata[\"structure\"] == \"COOP\" else empty_pasture_tiles\n","                if targets:\n","                    if unit_pos in targets and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                        claim(unit_pos)\n","                        return [\"PLACE\", animal]\n","                    t = pick_target(targets, unit_pos)\n","                    if t:\n","                        claim(t)\n","                        return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 4) harvest ripe tiles (crops & animal products)\n","        if harvest_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in harvest_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"HARVEST\"]\n","            t = pick_target(harvest_tiles, unit_pos, zone, strict=True)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 5) water thirsty plants\n","        if water_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in water_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"WATER\"]\n","            t = pick_target(water_tiles, unit_pos, zone, strict=True)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 6) care for animals (free yield bonus)\n","        if animal_care_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in animal_care_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"CARE\"]\n","            t = pick_target(animal_care_tiles, unit_pos)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 7) collect fertilizer sitting at an animal structure\n","        if animal_collect_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in animal_collect_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"COLLECT_FERTILIZER\"]\n","            t = pick_target(animal_collect_tiles, unit_pos)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 8) clear weeds to free tiles back up\n","        if weed_tiles:\n","            if unit_pos in weed_tiles and unit_pos not in claimed:\n","                claim(unit_pos)\n","                return [\"DIG\"]\n","            t = pick_target(weed_tiles, unit_pos, zone, strict=True)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","\n","        # 9) pickup logistics: wheat for feeding, fertilizer, or an animal to place\n","        need_wheat = bool(animal_feed_tiles) and shed.get(\"WHEAT\", 0) > wheat_feed_reserve\n","        need_fert = bool(fertilizable_tiles) and shed.get(\"FERTILIZER\", 0) > 0\n","        need_animal_pickup = None\n","        for animal, adata in ANIMALS.items():\n","            targets = empty_coop_tiles if adata[\"structure\"] == \"COOP\" else empty_pasture_tiles\n","            if targets and shed.get(animal, 0) > 0:\n","                need_animal_pickup = animal\n","                break\n","\n","        if (need_wheat or need_fert or need_animal_pickup) and not _is_shed_adjacent(unit_pos, board_size):\n","            t = pick_target(_shed_access_tiles(board_size), unit_pos)\n","            if t:\n","                claim(t)\n","                return [_step_towards(unit_pos, t)]\n","        if _is_shed_adjacent(unit_pos, board_size):\n","            if need_wheat:\n","                return [\"PICKUP\", \"WHEAT\", 1]\n","            if need_fert:\n","                return [\"PICKUP\", \"FERTILIZER\", 1]\